# - All test scripts use the new names

# ## 7. Pattern note across 7 passes
#
# Each prior pass applied a class of fix that left drift:
# - 7-slice: function-name prefix = file-name (mostly)
# - fresh-eyes: 17 additional findings (cap mappings, dead code)
# - post-rename: 5 prefix families
# - 5th deep-dive: 30+ findings including 3 broken references, 26+ dead fns
# - 6th deep-dive: 1 dead file, 1 prefix family, 14 unused imports
# - 7th deep-dive (this pass): 3 cap-induced splits that can now merge
#
# The 7th pass is unique: it looks for STRUCTURAL simplification (fewer
# files, more cohesion) rather than individual fixes. Per powerlaw, the
# 29-file state is healthier than 31 files.
